	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0402_man2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>サウンドデザイナー　ですけど
みんな　どの　きょくが　いいんだろ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T05:27:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T05:27:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>サウンドデザイナー　ですけど
みんな　どの　きょくが　いいんだろ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T05:27:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T05:27:45" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanで新規作成
※仮メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T05:27:50" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MAN2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T05:23:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0402_05_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぼく　サウンドデザイナー！▼
おんがくが　かわる　すてきな
しかけを　たくさん　いれたでー！▽
きみ　いくつ　きがついた？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ぼく　サウンドデザイナー！▼
音楽が　変わる　すてきな
しかけを　たくさん　いれたでー！▽
きみ　いくつ　気がついた？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・クリア前
※swanでメッセージ調整など</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T05:21:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#404040</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03r0402_05_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちゃんと　サウンド
きいてくれてる　きみだけに▽
とくべつ　だいサービス！▼
こんな　ドラマチックな
おんがくは　どない？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ちゃんと　サウンド
聴いてくれてる　きみだけに▽
特別　大サービス！▼
こんな　ドラマチックな
音楽は　どない？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・クリア後</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
